// Monde 1, niveau 1-2 (docs, section 6): learn le But. Jalonneurs go for the Borne-Mère,
// the first Fuyards (wave 4) head for the Refuge. Unlocks ronces and mortier.
// Map legend: see 1-1.ron.
(
    world: 1,
    // Where the sheet lies on the Marches: world position of its cell (0, 0) (`overworld`).
    at: (50.0, -6.0),
